# The custodian returns the package, naming the signed DCR.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | QMS_Pedro
type #login-password | Office123!
click button[type=submit] |
wait Requests
click .nav-item | Requests
wait With you as Document Custodian
click .series-row | ${DOC}
wait Return for defects
click button | Return for defects
wait What is wrong
click #return-signed_dcr |
type #return-comments | The Head's signature is missing on page 1.
click button | Return to the office
wait Returned for package defects · version
shot ${TAG}custodian-returned
errors
